  },
  {
    "id": 2016004020180,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん。仕事帰りに\r\n急にお誘いしてしまって……すみませんでした",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600402/2016004020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004020190,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……でも\r\nお付き合いいただき、ありがとうございました",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600402/2016004020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、千雪の気分転換になったならよかった\r\nそれに──",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "生き生きしてたな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "こういうのに\r\n熱中するんだな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "頼りになったよ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004020200,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……あ、えっと……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600402/2016004020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004020210,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "もしかして私、\r\nひとりではしゃいじゃってましたか……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600402/2016004020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや\r\n千雪が楽しそうにしてるから、俺も楽しかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004020220,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そ、そうですか……？\r\nそれなら、よかったです……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600402/2016004020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\nたまにはこういうのもいいもんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004020230,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい……！　……あの。私、今日、\r\nとっても楽しくって……それで……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600402/2016004020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004020240,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "次の『たまに』の機会も……\r\nまた、ご一緒させていただけますか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600402/2016004020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ……ああ\r\nもちろんだよ、俺でよければ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004020250,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……ありがとうございます\r\n……ふふ、約束ですよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600402/2016004020250"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "急にゲームセンターに寄るなんて言うから、\r\n何があるんだと思ったよ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004020260,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そうですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600402/2016004020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、千雪の新しい一面が見られてよかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004020270,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……！\r\nそっか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600402/2016004020270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004020280,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "それなら、私ももっと\r\n色んなことに挑戦していかなくちゃですね……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600402/2016004020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004020290,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "シューティングの次は……\r\n目指せクレーンゲーム名人！　とかでしょうか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600402/2016004020290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、いいじゃないか\r\nその時はまた見せてもらえると嬉しいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004020300,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はいっ\r\nもちろんです……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
